    "title": "MICROSERVICE-PROD-Create Correspondent Bank Operation Operational Action-spec",
    "description": "This API facilitates the management of operational actions related to correspondent bank operations within the banking payments system. It allows financial institutions to initiate new operational actions, streamlining processes such as setting up, updating, and managing banking transactions with correspondent banks. Typical users include banking professionals and financial system integrators who require efficient handling of cross-border payment operations. Leveraging this API enables enhanced operational workflows and improved transaction accuracy in international banking.",
